OL,3,GNEWSANo main Christmas lights switch-on
OL,4,A'embarrassing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorcester's failure to host for the
OL,7,Fthird time a full Christmas lights
OL,8,Fswitch-on event is embarrassing for the
OL,9,Fcity, a former mayor says.
OL,11,FThe traditional event in Cathedral
OL,12,FSquare has not taken place since 2023,
OL,13,Fwith the majority of city centre lights
OL,14,Filluminated this year with little
OL,15,Ffanfare.
OL,17,FCouncillor Mel Allcott urged the city
OL,18,Fto "pull your socks up". He said: "I
OL,19,Fknow finances are tight right now, but
OL,20,Fyou can get sponsorship for things like
OL,21,Fthis. It's not good enough."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
