OL,3,GNEWSANo main Christmas lights switch-on
OL,4,A'embarrassing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city council spokesperson said a
OL,7,Fscaled-down switch-on, as part of the
OL,8,FVictorian market opening, "maintained
OL,9,Fthe Christmas magic of the ceremony and
OL,10,Freduced costs".
